    },
    {
      "image": "page-18.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6aa804829114814de6423c9d5a76561b23724ed73cf016675fb321de79b5bd4d",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\n先穿袜子，再穿鞋。\n一张卡片，一个步骤。\n你的机器人会做什么？\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends/zh",
